      "fact_fields": ["vision.diplopia.present"],
      "licence_pathway": "conditional",
      "finding": "not_established",
      "conclusion": "While the patient meets visual acuity standards (6/6), the presence of diplopia within 20 degrees explicitly excludes eligibility for a conditional licence per PASS-8da032d63c954c0ce3d82598, rendering the acuity standard irrelevant to current fitness."
